        "title": "Replace Your Coffee With Cacao",
        "deck": "A gentler way to start your day, trading jitters and crashes for grounded, sustained energy, one cup at a time.",
        "meta_read": "12 Min Read",
        "meta_topic": "Energy &amp; Mood",
